-- 5. Dissolve — pads and drone only, then silence

-- fade the moving layers together (keep d1/d2/d3 for the tail)
fadeSilence 24 [4,5,6,7,8,9]

-- leave the low pad and sub
xfadeIn 2 24 $ lowPad # gain 0.68 # lpf 500

xfadeIn 1 24 $ subDrone # gain 0.76 # lpf 140

-- let the last chord ring, then hush
xfadeIn 3 24 $ highPad # gain 0.6 # lpf 900

-- final silence (uncomment when the tail has decayed)
-- fadeSilence 16 [1,2,3]
-- hush
